### Quick Installation (Debian 12 / Ubuntu)

```bash
wget https://github.com/Svarkovsky/flameshot-plus/releases/download/${VERSION}/flameshot-plus_12.1.0-1_amd64.deb
sudo apt install ./flameshot-plus_12.1.0-1_amd64.deb
```

Or run the standalone binary directly:
```bash
wget https://github.com/Svarkovsky/flameshot-plus/releases/download/${VERSION}/flameshot-plus
chmod +x ./flameshot-plus
./flameshot-plus gui
```

